   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Compound future",
     "texto": [
      "Imperfective verbs form the compound future with **będę, będziesz, będzie, będziemy, będziecie, będą** plus the infinitive: **będę pracować**.",
      "This form presents a future activity without stressing its end. In English it is often translated as «I will be doing», depending on the context."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
